	(descr "Pimoroni Tiny 2040 RP2040 module, castellated surface mount. Land pattern and board cutout taken verbatim from Pimoroni pimoroni-boards.lbr package TINY2040. Origin is at the module end (Pimoroni convention), not the body centre. Edge.Cuts carries Pimoroni's recommended 12.6 mm cutout for the components on the underside of the module; it is an OPEN polyline and must be closed by the board outline at the USB end.")
